Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Spectrum at finite coupling", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.856442447631379*^9, 
  3.856442453325783*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3528233d-b8ab-4a7c-bddb-\
cc7e89e6145d"],

Cell["\<\
Data on the first 10 states. Here, the states are ordered as they appear at \
weak coupling. We estimate at least 12 significant digits for each point (we \
expect that the precision is actually  higher for most points, and exceeds 20 \
digits at weak coupling). The format is  {g ,  \[CapitalDelta](g) }\
\>", "Text",
